// The M1-side binary search. loop_while's cond and step are Fn REFERENCES
// resolved at emit time (iter.rs:3-7), so the array a step reads cannot be
// chosen at runtime — hence one probe fn and one scan fn per projection, with
// rt_lb / rt_scan as the dispatchers. Every one is `deterministic false`: they
// read and write process-scoped u32 arrays and raw scratch, and declaring a
// probe pure would let CCall CSE hash-cons two probes of a shrinking window
