// ── P3: the durable tier (AXVERITY_FORMAT_LAND_AND_WIRE_V1) ────────────────
// Cold rebuild from the durable structure stream, a durable name -> RID index,
// and point reads. Everything here is `effect fullIo` / `deterministic false`
// honestly: these fns read the filesystem and their answers change as the
// store grows. Declaring a scan pure would let CCall CSE hash-cons two scans
// into one — which is how the write path's real packing loop briefly ceased to
// exist.

